      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will likely get out of sync with the version specified in the `repo` manifest. \n\nIt looks like we can put arbitrary scripts here. Can you add a function to get the correct revision?\n\nFor example,\n\n```\nrepo info external/gob/boringssl/boringssl | grep \u0027Manifest revision\u0027\n```\n\nNote that this will probably require you to add steps in this `yml` file to [set up `depot_tools`](https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/chrome-infra-docs/flat/depot_tools/docs/html/depot_tools_tutorial.html#_setting_up) and [clone the `manifest` repo](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/manifest/).",
