      "writtenOn": "2023-04-06T10:39:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Installing depot_tools would not work, because `repo info` requires the ChromiumOS source tree setup correctly.\n\n```\n$ repo init -u https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/manifest -b main\n$ repo info external/gob/boringssl/boringssl | grep \u0027Manifest revision\u0027\nerror: project external/gob/boringssl/boringssl (src/third_party/boringssl) not found\n```\n\nI believe the script would not want to download the chromeos source tree.\n\n----\nA possible solution for that is parsing the XML manually:\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/manifest/+/HEAD/full.xml\n\n```\n$ grep boringssl .repo/manifests/full.xml -A3 | grep revision\n           revision\u003d\"e0d601a57fde7d67a1c771e7d87468faf1f8fe55\"\n```\n\nBut I don\u0027t think that is a better idea.\n\n---\n\nBTW, I think the proper solution is setting up a branch name for boringssl, and use the branch name here.\n\nFiled a bug for that: b/277182059",
      "parentUuid": "4d846c71_71e0515d",
