      "writtenOn": "2023-04-06T23:55:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even if we have a branch, we will have to hope that no one ever changes the branch name in the manifest, which is not guaranteed (e.g., someone decides that boringssl needs to be updated to get a security fix and just changes it to a specific commit with the fix).\n\nI think you can add this to your commands to only sync the boringssl project:\n\n```\n$ repo init -u https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/manifest -b main\n$ repo info external/gob/boringssl/boringssl | grep \u0027Manifest revision\u0027\n$ repo sync external/gob/boringssl/boringssl\n```",
